Description: local AI assistant for your desktop
 openTARS is an AI assistant that runs on your own machine. It understands
 requests in English and Portuguese and works on the desktop: opens and
 closes apps, clicks buttons by name, types, searches the web, looks at the
 screen and runs terminal commands, asking before anything risky.
 .
 Its official AI is Gargantua 2.5 (Gemma 4), trained to use the openTARS
 tools, which sees images and understands speech. It runs on the llama.cpp
 engine, downloaded with the models the first time the app opens. Comes with
 a window ("opentars-gui"), a quick bar opened by a global shortcut, text
 actions in any app and a terminal mode ("opentars --chat"). Local by
 default; cloud models are optional and use your own key.
